        "like_count": 19,
        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "The myopic focus on TAM for startup ideas feels like a bug of the current startup meta. Markets are rarely too small, especially if they are growing quickly.\n\nThe real risk is not being able to win a market by going too broad.",
